1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
What is your favorite thing about your wife?

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:05,080
I think Layla has more fight in her than most people have.

3
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:06,720
She will just keep going.

4
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:11,460
And so she will fail, she will get knocked down,

5
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:13,580
she will have pain, she will suffer,

6
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:15,640
and then she will just continue to try again.

7
00:00:15,640 --> 00:00:18,600
And so she just doesn't have a lot of give up in her.

8
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:21,040
And I have a tremendous amount of respect for that.

